@ApiClinica_HostAddress = http://localhost:5070

### Liveness
GET {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/alive
Accept: application/json

### Listar pacientes
GET {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes
Accept: application/json

### Criar paciente
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Souza",
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "telefone": "(47) 98888-7777",
  "dataNasc": "1990-05-12",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-09"
}

### Criar médico
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/medicos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Dr. Carlos Lima",
  "email": "carlos@clinica.com",
  "telefone": "(47) 3344-5566",
  "crm": "12345/SC"
}

### Criar consulta
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/consultas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pacienteId": 1,
  "medicoId": 1,
  "dataHora": "2026-12-15T10:00:00"
}

###
